{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4b6beefc-02df-81bd-afc9-2f52096f73a8",
  "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:48:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Priya Nguyen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:45:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. Good afternoon, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:45:44-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. This is Priya Nguyen, I'm at 187 Memorial Boulevard, down by Easton's Beach. I've got my water and sewer bill here and I don't see why the sewer is more than the water. That doesn't seem right to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:45:59-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happy to look at it with you. Sewer's usually figured off the water you use, and the rate for sewer is typically higher than the water rate. So it's pretty common for that line to come out bigger. Let me pull up the account. Is it in your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:46:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, no. It's still in my husband's name. He passed, and I never got it changed over. I just keep paying it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:46:25-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fine, I can still see it. I'm sorry for your loss. So here, the water line is what you used, and the sewer line is charged on that same usage, just at a higher rate. Nothing looks off to me. You didn't get billed twice or anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:46:43-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. Well, it still seems like a lot, for one person. I'd like that written down, if you can. What you just told me, the way the sewer is figured. I don't follow it well enough on the phone, and I'd like to have it on paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:47:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. I'll send a plain explanation to the mailing address on the account. Is that still 187 Memorial?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:47:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. Same place forty years."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:47:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. It should go out in the next few days. Anything else on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:47:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'd like to pay it now, while I have you. It's a hundred sixty-seven dollars and thirty-five cents. Let me get my card. [pause] Okay. It's 5105 1051 0510 5100. Expiration is 10 twenty-nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:47:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, I've got that. 5105 1051 0510 5100, expiring 10/29, for $167.35. Go ahead and hold on a second while I run it. [pause] All set, that went through. You'll see it posted on the account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:47:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Well, that's one thing done. I tell you, this week nothing goes right. I bought myself a puzzle, a thousand pieces, and a hundred of them are missing. A hundred! I counted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:47:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no. That's aggravating, a puzzle with holes in it. Hopefully the store takes it back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:48:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They'd better. Anyway, you'll send the letter then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:48:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Have a good weekend, Mrs. Nguyen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T14:48:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
